<title>USA: AudioNet says Motorola invested in company.</title>
<headline>AudioNet says Motorola invested in company.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AudioNet, which gathers and broadcasts audio on the Internet, said Monday that Motorola Inc invested an undisclosed amount in the company through a subsidiary.</p>
<p>The investment was made through Motorola's New Enterprises unit.</p>
<p>AudioNet also announced that Premiere Radio Networks Inc, which produces and distributes network radio programming and services, has signed a letter of intent for a $4 million equity investment in the company.</p>
</text>
